# setuptools path traversal in its package downloader (setuptools.package_index).
# Reported for the pkg_resources that pip bundles from setuptools 70.3.0 in the
# builder image (nbsandbox-runner-builder); pip doesn't bundle the downloader,
# and builds install wheels from the configured index only.
CVE-2025-47273
